# Run the AppHost (samples/SpineMessagingSample.AppHost), then send these. The API's port is in the Aspire dashboard.
@api = http://localhost:5240

### The topology: subscribers, lanes and types
GET {{api}}/

### Ten pictures of 100 KB at normal priority, then two at high priority: the high ones go first
POST {{api}}/images?count=10&kilobytes=100

###
POST {{api}}/images?count=2&kilobytes=20&priority=High

### Low priority: waits until the work lanes above it are empty
POST {{api}}/index?reason=after-import

### A receipt due in 30 seconds. A repeat for the same order within the hour is a duplicate.
POST {{api}}/receipts?order=order-42&delaySeconds=30

### Cancel it with the id and due time from the answer above
DELETE {{api}}/receipts/MESSAGE_ID?due=DUE_TIME

### Fails twice and then succeeds (3 attempts are allowed)
POST {{api}}/flaky?failTimes=2

### Fails every attempt and ends among the failed messages
POST {{api}}/flaky?failTimes=5

### The failed messages
GET {{api}}/failed

### Replay one
POST {{api}}/failed/flaky/MESSAGE_ID/replay

### Clean up now rather than on the hour
POST {{api}}/janitor

### A generated postcard: 202 while it is made (ask again after Retry-After), then 200 with the image's URL.
### Needs an OpenAI key; without one the answer is 404 { "off": "notConfigured" }.
GET {{api}}/ai/assets/Postcard/visby
Spine-Installation: sample-phone

### A city the app does not know: 404, and nothing is ordered
GET {{api}}/ai/assets/Postcard/atlantis
Spine-Installation: sample-phone
